t":72.31,"dist":1275,"tt":1548,"src":[3]},"sea":{"zh":"塔斯曼海出海口","en":"Entrance from the Tasman Sea","label":{"zh":"塔斯曼海","en":"Tasman Sea"},"lat":-44.58346,"lon":167.79338,"h":0,"side":"R","t":138.18,"dist":119,"tt":3079,"src":[2]},"bowen":{"zh":"博文瀑布","en":"Hineteawa / Bowen Falls","label":{"zh":"博文瀑布","en":"Hineteawa / Bowen Falls"},"lat":-44.665108,"lon":167.9262033,"h":162,"side":"L","t":298.42,"dist":301,"tt":6287,"src":[2]}},"shots":[{"t0":0.0,"dur":4.0,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":4.0,"dur":13.0,"zh":["遊船從米佛峽灣碼頭出發，駛向塔斯曼海。","這裡年雨量平均 6,412 毫米，是紐西蘭最潮濕的有人居住地之一。"],"en":["The cruise leaves the Milford Sound wharf, heading for the Tasman Sea.","With 6,412 mm of rain a year, it is one of the wettest inhabited places in New Zealand."]},{"t0":17.0,"dur":49.46,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":66.46,"dur":13.0,"zh":["左側是冠峰，海拔 1,690 公尺，幾乎垂直地落入水中。","史托克斯船長覺得它像主教戴的法冠，因此命名。"],"en":["On the left: Mitre Peak, 1,690 m, dropping almost sheer into the water.","Captain John Lort Stokes named it for its likeness to a bishop's mitre."],"poi":"mitre"},{"t0":79.46,"dur":52.87,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":132.33,"dur":13.0,"zh":["來到出海口，外面就是塔斯曼海。","峽灣從這裡深入內陸 15 公里，兩側峭壁高達 1,200 公尺以上。"],"en":["At the mouth of the sound, the Tasman Sea lies beyond.","From here the fiord runs 15 km inland between cliffs 1,200 m high or more."],"poi":"sea"},{"t0":145.33,"dur":132.17,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":277.5,"dur":13.0,"zh":["回到碼頭旁的博文瀑布，峽灣兩道終年不斷的瀑布之一。","作家吉卜林曾稱這裡是「世界第八大奇景」。"],"en":["Back at the wharf by Bowen Falls, one of the two permanent waterfalls in the sound.","Rudyard Kipling called it the eighth Wonder of the World."]},{"t0":290.5,"dur":9.5,"zh":[],"en":[]}],"log":[{"t":0.0,"tt":0,"kind":"dep","zh":"啟航：米佛峽灣遊客碼頭","en":"Departure: Milford Sound visitor terminal"},{"t":72.31,"tt":1548,"kind":"poi","zh":"左側 1 公里：冠峰","en":"Mitre Peak, 1 km left","k":"mitre"},{"t":138.18,"tt":3079,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 119 公尺：塔斯曼海","en":"Tasman Sea, 119 m right","k":"sea"},{"t":298.42,"tt":6287,"kind":"poi","zh":"左側 301 公尺：博文瀑布","en":"Hineteawa / Bowen Falls, 301 m left","k":"bowen"},{"t":300.0,"tt":6300,"kind":"arr","zh":"抵達：米佛峽灣遊客碼頭","en":"Arrival: Milford Sound visitor terminal"}],"note":{"zh":"模擬畫面：路線取自 OpenStreetMap，速度與時間為示意，並非實際班次紀錄；地形與衛星影像為真實資料。","en":"Simulation: the path comes from OpenStreetMap; speeds and times are illustrative, not a real timetable. Terrain and satellite imagery are real data."},"geo_src":"OSM way 371474355 (route=ferry, operator Southern Discoveries, from GPS traces): loop from the Milford Sound visitor terminal to the Tasman Sea and back","sources":[{"title":"OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL), route geometry","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"},{"title":"Wikiwand / Wikipedia (en): Milford Sound","url":"https://www.wikiwand.com/en/articles/Milford_Sound"},{"title":"Wikiwand / Wikipedia (en): Mitre Peak, New Zealand","url":"https://wikiwand.com/en/articles/Mitre_Peak,_New_Zealand"}]}